            },
            "reviewBody": "This is okay for a veggie dip. I was a bit leary bc it's only mayo--I'm not a big fan of mayo. But it's actually not bad. Bf thought it was \"weird\" but ate half of it, so it passes. I might use 1/2 sour cream, 1/2 mayo to see if I like it better that way. Thanks!"
